  "bio": "Lucas Corteletti is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in neotraditional styles, located in the vibrant city of Vitória, Brazil. Visitors of his studio in Vila Velha-ES consistently praise his exceptional professionalism, ensuring every aspect of the tattooing experience is handled with the utmost care and attention to detail. With Lucas, clients can expect a seamless blend of artistry and meticulous service.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Vitória, Espirito Santo, Brazil"
